[36m(TaskRunner pid=241058)[0m [response] To determine how many miles from City \( A \) Alicia and Beth will meet, we need to calculate the time it takes for them to meet and then use that time to find the distance.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=241058)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=241058)[0m First, let's calculate the time it takes for Alicia and Beth to meet. Alicia bikes at a speed of 18 miles per hour, and Beth bikes at a speed of 12 miles per hour. Since they are biking towards each other, their relative speed is the sum of their individual speeds:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=241058)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=241058)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=241058)[0m 18 \text{ miles per hour} + 12 \text{ miles per hour} = 30 \text{ miles per hour}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=241058)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=241058)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=241058)[0m Next, we use the formula for time, which is distance divided by speed:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=241058)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=241058)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=241058)[0m \text{Time} = \frac{\text{Distance}}{\text{Speed}}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=241058)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=241058)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=241058)[0m Here, the distance is 45 miles and the speed is 30 miles per hour. Plugging in these values, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=241058)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=241058)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=241058)[0m \text{Time} = \frac{45 \text{ miles}}{30 \text{ miles per hour}} = 1.5 \text{ hours}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=241058)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=241058)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=241058)[0m Now, we use the time to find the distance. The distance is the product of the speed and the time:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=241058)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=241058)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=241058)[0m \text{Distance} = \text{Speed} \times \text{Time} = 30 \text{ miles per hour} \times 1.5 \text{ hours} = 45 \text{ miles}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=241058)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=241058)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=241058)[0m Therefore, Alicia and Beth will be \boxed{45} miles from City \( A \) when they meet.
