[36m(TaskRunner pid=241058)[0m - \( h = 9 \) cm (the height of the trapezoid)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=241058)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=241058)[0m Now, we can substitute these values into the area formula:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=241058)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=241058)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=241058)[0m \text{Area} = \frac{1}{2} \times (5 + 3) \times 9
