[36m(TaskRunner pid=241058)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=241058)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=241058)[0m Finally, multiply by \(\frac{1}{2}\):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=241058)[0m 
