[36m(TaskRunner pid=241058)[0m First, let's calculate the time it takes for Alicia and Beth to meet. Alicia bikes at a speed of 18 miles per hour and Beth bikes at a speed of 12 miles per hour. Since they are biking towards each other, their relative speed is the sum of their individual speeds:
